WEBVTT

00:10.040 --> 00:11.480
<i>It hasn't changed.</i>

00:11.910 --> 00:13.550
<i>I guess that's to be expected.</i>

00:16.500 --> 00:20.630
<i>Before time turned back, 
I used to come here to shop.</i>

00:23.200 --> 00:23.920
Right here.

00:24.230 --> 00:25.170
Oh.

00:25.670 --> 00:26.820
It's through here.

00:31.360 --> 00:33.630
I've never been here before.

00:48.790 --> 00:50.460
"Wujukeun's store."

00:50.790 --> 00:53.440
"No refund for changing your mind."

00:53.440 --> 00:55.950
"No refund for defective products."

00:56.510 --> 00:59.160
So no refund whatsoever, huh?

01:00.310 --> 01:02.960
Talk about obsessed with money.

01:04.200 --> 01:08.460
Desir, I don't want to hold 
that sword ever again.

01:09.460 --> 01:10.540
Never.

01:14.060 --> 01:15.470
Won't you give me a chance?

01:34.830 --> 01:42.000
<i>Fate is always more heroic than any story</i>

01:44.370 --> 01:51.150
<i>The one and only despair flaunts 
a completely different sky</i>

01:51.150 --> 01:53.720
<i>A stolen smile</i>

01:53.720 --> 02:03.100
<i>Put a period on the nights 
of lament and depression</i>

02:03.100 --> 02:07.730
<i>When the season comes around 
for the second time, gear yourself up</i>

02:07.730 --> 02:12.150
<i>For the final challenge</i>

02:12.150 --> 02:15.580
<i>Why don't we struggle, cry, and bloom away?</i>

02:15.580 --> 02:21.780
<i>I have a future, a future I want to 
go back to no matter what it takes</i>

02:21.780 --> 02:25.120
<i>Here we go and embrace 
the next life, nice to meet you</i>

02:25.120 --> 02:32.170
<i>There's a world, a world 
I want to repaint with you</i>

02:32.170 --> 02:34.500
<i>Let's go see the end together</i>

02:34.500 --> 02:37.140
<i>The ending credits signal the beginning</i>

02:37.140 --> 02:41.980
<i>A special story drawn by light and shadow</i>

02:41.980 --> 02:44.310
<i>Ge ge ge ge ge get back</i>

02:44.310 --> 02:46.940
<i>To my own story</i>

02:50.520 --> 02:55.030
<b></b>Episode 5

02:50.520 --> 02:55.030
<b>    Rapier</b>

03:03.750 --> 03:06.180
Security is perfect.

03:19.610 --> 03:22.180
Enter, customer. Here.

03:31.650 --> 03:33.670
<i>Heavily guarded, I see.</i>

03:35.590 --> 03:38.410
One face I saw yesterday.

03:39.510 --> 03:41.830
Another face that's new to me.

03:42.140 --> 03:45.100
Welcome. I'm the store owner, Wujukeun.

03:50.910 --> 03:54.760
So? Are you here to sell, or buy?

03:55.550 --> 03:58.800
I'm here to buy the rapier he sold.

03:59.340 --> 04:02.850
Didn't you read my "No Refunds" sign outside?

04:03.570 --> 04:05.850
That's why I'm here to buy it off you.

04:06.860 --> 04:08.600
Okay.

04:11.800 --> 04:13.360
This is it, yes?

04:15.540 --> 04:19.790
I already told him that this 
has no value as a sword.

04:20.200 --> 04:22.740
As a sword, mind you.

04:22.740 --> 04:23.730
What?

04:24.680 --> 04:28.190
I knew something was off 
because it was so light.

04:28.530 --> 04:31.500
They rarely comes in this size, 
but it's most likely—

04:31.500 --> 04:32.580
A kemuvin.

04:33.050 --> 04:34.590
You know about it?

04:35.150 --> 04:37.110
I've seen one before.

04:44.150 --> 04:48.060
It's used by nobility to give a gift to a lover.

04:48.060 --> 04:50.060
Like a box.

04:50.930 --> 04:52.390
To a lover?

04:52.980 --> 04:57.190
Unfortunately, I couldn't 
figure out how to open it.

04:59.990 --> 05:01.200
How much is it?

05:03.900 --> 05:05.370
Forty silver.

05:05.920 --> 05:07.100
Wait a minute!

05:07.540 --> 05:10.330
I sold it to you for three silver!

05:10.710 --> 05:13.460
And you didn't tell me 
that it was a kemuvin!

05:14.030 --> 05:17.540
You asked me to appraise the <i>sword</i>.

05:17.540 --> 05:21.930
So, I appraised it as a sword, 
which was worth three silver.

05:22.380 --> 05:25.950
Now I'm selling it as a <i>kemuvin</i>.

05:25.950 --> 05:28.890
Its value is 40 silver.

05:29.570 --> 05:30.890
Get it?

05:31.710 --> 05:33.550
You swindler!

05:33.550 --> 05:36.320
It's called business, little boy.

05:36.320 --> 05:37.990
That's enough, Pram.

05:38.270 --> 05:39.280
But...!

05:39.770 --> 05:42.060
Regretfully, the store owner is right.

05:42.790 --> 05:46.680
It seems your friend can tell right from wrong.

05:47.060 --> 05:48.480
So, what do you say?

05:52.670 --> 05:54.170
We'll buy it for 40 silver.

05:54.170 --> 05:55.170
What?

05:55.620 --> 05:58.670
No hesitation? That's a surprise.

05:58.980 --> 06:02.630
Maybe I should have asked for more.

06:03.010 --> 06:06.510
But that's as high as I go, all right?

06:06.510 --> 06:07.950
You bet.

06:07.950 --> 06:09.770
It's a deal.

06:14.820 --> 06:17.510
Looking won't get you anywhere.

06:17.510 --> 06:20.030
An amateur can't open that thing.

06:33.780 --> 06:35.170
Here, Pram.

06:36.300 --> 06:37.580
But...

06:38.000 --> 06:39.460
Come on, just take it.

06:44.110 --> 06:46.400
There's a groove in the hilt.

06:46.400 --> 06:48.220
Pull it with your nail...

06:48.640 --> 06:49.620
This?

06:53.360 --> 06:55.400
And remove the "blade."

06:56.060 --> 06:57.520
Like this?

07:00.940 --> 07:02.130
What?!

07:02.440 --> 07:03.690
Huh?!

07:04.420 --> 07:05.690
Isn't this...?

07:07.440 --> 07:08.660
I knew it.

07:09.510 --> 07:11.300
It's neither iron nor silver.

07:11.680 --> 07:14.630
I've never seen... shining metal like this!

07:15.410 --> 07:16.800
Of course you haven't.

07:16.800 --> 07:19.460
That is made from blancium.

07:19.460 --> 07:20.480
What?!

07:20.480 --> 07:23.760
Are you sure?! Is that really blancium?!

07:23.760 --> 07:24.660
Yes.

07:25.080 --> 07:28.280
Harder than steel
and lighter than a feather.

07:28.280 --> 07:31.370
It's metal that's used only in 
the highest quality weapons.

07:32.740 --> 07:37.130
<i>And this shine... This is 
the weapon Pram used to use.</i>

07:38.820 --> 07:40.480
Come on, let's go back.

07:40.480 --> 07:43.480
Uh... Y-Yes!

07:48.230 --> 07:49.970
If you would kindly remove him.

07:50.620 --> 07:53.620
Once you leave that sword behind you.

07:54.280 --> 07:56.410
What you sold was a kemuvin.

07:57.040 --> 07:59.010
I paid for it.

07:59.330 --> 08:01.290
I trust that the deal was made.

08:01.660 --> 08:04.880
If that's blancium, 
it's a whole different story.

08:05.710 --> 08:08.890
But you said the same thing to Pram earlier.

08:10.230 --> 08:11.890
Are you going back on your own words?

08:11.890 --> 08:13.600
Shut up, brat!

08:15.340 --> 08:17.680
"No," master said.

08:17.680 --> 08:19.310
Sword, leave and go.

08:21.670 --> 08:25.690
That speech reminds me of my friend.

08:26.380 --> 08:28.220
Want to get hurt?

08:28.220 --> 08:29.780
I'd rather not.

08:33.500 --> 08:34.400
Dodged?

08:35.740 --> 08:38.120
What are you doing?! 
Take care of him already!

08:38.120 --> 08:40.290
O-Okay...

08:45.020 --> 08:45.920
Pram.

08:46.740 --> 08:48.170
Please keep your distance.

08:51.630 --> 08:53.570
I don't like fighting,

08:54.340 --> 08:58.030
but if you mean to harm Desir, 
I won't hold back.

09:00.040 --> 09:01.070
Pram...

09:01.070 --> 09:02.520
Leave it to me!

09:02.520 --> 09:07.030
Didn't you say you'd never
 use that sword again?

09:07.030 --> 09:08.240
Wha?!

09:08.240 --> 09:11.990
Eh, um, well...

09:15.160 --> 09:16.290
I'm just kidding.

09:17.150 --> 09:19.790
Show me what you're truly capable of.

09:19.790 --> 09:22.540
Y... Yes!

09:29.860 --> 09:30.970
Here I go.

09:39.470 --> 09:43.770
<i>Yes. That sword suits Pram perfectly.</i>

09:44.940 --> 09:48.780
<i>But his opponent's attacks 
can be fatal if they land.</i>

09:49.420 --> 09:53.030
<i>Pram is still inexperienced. Can he win?</i>

10:08.150 --> 10:10.190
Those eyes, I like!

10:10.190 --> 10:12.290
I fight!

10:12.290 --> 10:14.070
I defeat you!

10:14.480 --> 10:16.550
Let's go, warrior!

10:29.570 --> 10:30.570
So fast...

10:42.620 --> 10:43.520
So fast.

10:43.520 --> 10:44.720
Can't see.

10:45.050 --> 10:47.190
He is... strong.

10:47.810 --> 10:49.770
I have...

10:49.770 --> 10:51.460
fun!

10:55.910 --> 10:56.930
<i>Too shallow.</i>

10:56.930 --> 11:00.740
<i>Is he having a problem gauging 
the distance with a rapier?</i>

11:06.450 --> 11:07.900
<i>The guy's getting used to Pram's speed.</i>

11:08.230 --> 11:10.070
<i>If the fight drags on, 
Pram's at a disadvantage.</i>

11:13.900 --> 11:17.290
<i>Yes, Pram will have to aim 
for the vital point.</i>

11:18.560 --> 11:19.240
<i>But...</i>

11:24.320 --> 11:25.810
<i>The guy will naturally see it through.</i>

11:34.590 --> 11:36.060
You finished?

11:37.490 --> 11:38.430
Pram!

11:40.560 --> 11:43.100
Believe in your father!

11:43.100 --> 11:44.280
What...?

12:02.950 --> 12:05.770
I will, Desir!

12:07.440 --> 12:10.270
Good, warrior!

12:10.850 --> 12:12.920
<i>I don't know what to make of you.</i>

12:13.450 --> 12:17.130
<i>The secret of this sword... 
These inscriptions on it...</i>

12:17.570 --> 12:20.560
<i>Did you know them all?</i>

12:20.560 --> 12:21.680
<i>But for now...</i>

12:22.660 --> 12:25.040
<i>I'll bring you victory, for you believed in me!</i>

12:27.480 --> 12:28.480
No.

12:42.260 --> 12:43.070
Hold on!

12:45.690 --> 12:47.170
Pram!

12:50.390 --> 12:51.450
Pram!

13:11.980 --> 13:13.000
Are you okay?

13:14.750 --> 13:16.420
I managed to defeat him.

13:18.420 --> 13:22.250
Without this sword, I'd be the one on the floor.

13:23.350 --> 13:24.920
It's thanks to my father.

13:26.620 --> 13:27.990
Good for you.

13:27.990 --> 13:28.980
Thank you!

13:30.790 --> 13:31.980
Shall we go?

13:31.980 --> 13:33.000
Yes!

13:35.160 --> 13:37.000
And where exactly are you going?

13:37.510 --> 13:42.510
The door can only be opened 
by the guy you knocked down there.

13:42.510 --> 13:45.590
If you want to get out, leave the sword behind—

13:49.210 --> 13:51.430
It's open, Desir.

13:51.430 --> 13:53.230
Thanks, Pram.

13:53.620 --> 13:54.480
Huh?

13:59.730 --> 14:00.810
Welcome!

14:00.810 --> 14:03.170
Come on, do take a look!

14:09.260 --> 14:09.890
Pram.

14:09.890 --> 14:10.660
Yes?!

14:11.030 --> 14:12.490
Are you hungry?

14:12.890 --> 14:13.870
Let's grab something to eat.

14:13.870 --> 14:16.680
Y-Yes, I am! Let's eat!

14:19.330 --> 14:20.580
Two, please.

14:20.580 --> 14:21.540
Sure thing!

14:23.310 --> 14:25.040
Here. It's my treat.

14:25.040 --> 14:27.350
Th-Thank you so much!

14:27.350 --> 14:28.810
No big deal.

14:29.510 --> 14:34.650
N-Not just about the skewer, 
but also about the sword... and stuff...

14:35.120 --> 14:36.710
I said it's no big deal.

14:39.180 --> 14:41.390
You have your own situation.

14:42.710 --> 14:45.800
Maybe I shouldn't have interfered.

14:46.920 --> 14:50.720
But still, we are a party.

14:52.350 --> 14:55.800
When your friend is in trouble, 
it's natural to help them out.

15:00.300 --> 15:02.920
Wait, you don't like the skewers?

15:02.920 --> 15:04.550
Oh, no!

15:05.110 --> 15:06.510
That's not it...

15:09.590 --> 15:11.660
So much happened before I came here.

15:12.320 --> 15:15.050
I lost everything I believed in.

15:15.560 --> 15:18.320
I didn't know what I was supposed to do.

15:20.630 --> 15:21.540
But...

15:22.620 --> 15:26.750
but I now have someone who calls me a friend.

15:28.060 --> 15:31.600
I... I'm happy!

15:32.510 --> 15:34.440
Let's eat before it gets cold.

15:35.350 --> 15:37.260
Yes! Thank you for the food!

15:40.640 --> 15:43.300
<i>Thank you, Mother.</i>

15:44.370 --> 15:46.520
<i>I got to meet someone wonderful.</i>

15:47.790 --> 15:51.010
<i>Thank you, Father.</i>

15:56.120 --> 16:00.800
<i>I'll walk my path with him, 
along with the words you left for me.</i>

16:04.660 --> 16:08.650
<i>"So my fledgling won't lose his way."</i>

16:23.270 --> 16:24.210
Stop!

16:35.350 --> 16:37.420
I did it!

16:37.810 --> 16:40.120
Take that, Desir!

16:42.440 --> 16:44.550
No one's here.

16:58.830 --> 17:00.250
Here I go.

17:06.060 --> 17:07.420
Wind Strike!

17:09.580 --> 17:10.680
Now!

17:25.730 --> 17:27.770
I did it!

17:31.820 --> 17:32.960
Okay.

17:40.080 --> 17:42.880
Wait, why is a beta here?

17:42.880 --> 17:45.730
Must have come to watch us 
because she's jealous.

17:49.010 --> 17:50.060
Romantica.

17:51.670 --> 17:52.710
Thanks for waiting.

18:02.580 --> 18:04.060
Enjoy your meal.

18:06.040 --> 18:07.850
Wow!

18:08.850 --> 18:11.410
Doesn't even compare 
with the beta class, does it?

18:11.890 --> 18:15.200
It's my treat, so don't be shy.

18:17.020 --> 18:19.200
I guess you're not.

18:21.610 --> 18:24.670
Thank you, it was very good.

18:25.550 --> 18:26.510
So?

18:28.040 --> 18:30.660
Did you come here today 
to give me your reply?

18:31.700 --> 18:32.540
Yes.

18:32.540 --> 18:33.680
That's good.

18:35.320 --> 18:36.810
Shall we go, then?

18:37.160 --> 18:39.680
I'd like to introduce you 
to the members of Blue Moon.

18:42.670 --> 18:44.640
I came here to return this to you.

18:48.310 --> 18:49.830
I don't understand.

18:50.780 --> 18:52.110
I bet.

18:53.050 --> 18:55.500
Are you saying you don't 
want to go out with me?

18:56.430 --> 18:57.430
No.

18:57.850 --> 19:00.430
I mean, I guess I am?

19:00.430 --> 19:03.140
Anyhow, it's not just that.

19:03.750 --> 19:07.460
I joined a party in the beta class.

19:08.100 --> 19:09.140
Beta class?

19:10.360 --> 19:12.620
Ha! That doesn't make sense.

19:12.620 --> 19:14.570
Did they threaten you?

19:14.570 --> 19:15.500
If so, I can—

19:15.500 --> 19:16.820
I chose to do it.

19:18.280 --> 19:22.010
I didn't like it in the beginning, 
but now I'm having fun.

19:22.430 --> 19:26.230
The leader is training me, 
and I'm improving my skills.

19:27.700 --> 19:29.480
Say, you mentioned before

19:29.480 --> 19:33.190
that the beta class was a collection 
of commoners, all of them trash.

19:33.610 --> 19:34.990
So what?

19:34.990 --> 19:36.450
Commoners <i>are</i> trash.

19:37.770 --> 19:39.480
No plan to change that statement?

19:39.480 --> 19:40.760
Of course not.

19:41.690 --> 19:44.250
I used to be a commoner.

19:46.820 --> 19:49.210
Wow, you look scary.

19:51.190 --> 19:53.050
Please stop joking.

19:53.770 --> 19:55.140
I'm not joking.

19:55.560 --> 20:00.450
That's why I was put into the beta 
class even though I'm a noble.

20:01.170 --> 20:04.740
But now, I'm thinking it's fine.

20:06.460 --> 20:10.690
My party won't look at me 
the way you just did.

20:14.170 --> 20:18.530
Had I known you were a commoner, 
I wouldn't have invited you to our party.

20:19.550 --> 20:22.040
I will commend you for being honest.

20:22.390 --> 20:25.090
I guess this is how it ends, huh?

20:25.090 --> 20:27.980
It annoys me that it went 
exactly how he predicted,

20:28.390 --> 20:30.180
but I guess that's that.

20:31.010 --> 20:34.590
Our party is planning 
to get promoted to the alpha class.

20:35.550 --> 20:38.050
That makes us enemies.

20:39.340 --> 20:42.000
I'll crush every single one of you.

20:43.190 --> 20:46.660
You'd be wise not to 
look down on us too much.

20:47.030 --> 20:48.110
See you!

20:48.110 --> 20:50.060
Thanks for the good food.

21:02.450 --> 21:04.640
Kill the nobles!

21:07.490 --> 21:10.170
Execute the head of the house of Hadoon!

21:10.990 --> 21:13.080
Punish the nobles!

21:13.420 --> 21:14.410
Kill them!

21:14.410 --> 21:15.550
Kill them!

21:19.990 --> 21:21.370
Dad!

21:29.370 --> 21:31.540
You dirty commoner!

21:34.770 --> 21:37.520
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:37.520 --> 21:40.230
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:40.230 --> 21:43.840
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

21:48.320 --> 21:53.730
<i>All emotions will fade away sooner or later</i>

21:53.730 --> 21:58.330
<i>So we can pretend it's all a fairy tale</i>

21:59.080 --> 22:04.450
<i>Even love is just a fleeting dream</i>

22:04.450 --> 22:08.880
<i>So let's throw the dice 
and see what's in store</i>

22:09.230 --> 22:15.400
<i>I rolled a six today, eight times in a row</i>

22:15.400 --> 22:20.660
<i>But who knows what 
tomorrow's play will bring?</i>

22:20.660 --> 22:25.690
<i>I hope one day we'll be able to say</i>

22:25.690 --> 22:29.900
<i>That not knowing was the best part</i>

22:31.410 --> 22:34.180
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:34.180 --> 22:36.870
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:36.870 --> 22:40.380
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

22:42.250 --> 22:45.090
<i>If we happen to meet again in the next life</i>

22:45.090 --> 22:47.670
<i>I'll take any help I can get, 
even my own cat's</i>

22:47.670 --> 22:50.380
<i>Because this time</i>

22:50.380 --> 22:54.510
<i>I'll roll a three</i>

23:05.800 --> 23:08.360
Hey, did you interview Hebrion Academy?

23:08.360 --> 23:09.410
Not yet!

23:10.540 --> 23:12.570
Has anything like this ever happened before?!

23:12.570 --> 23:14.300
Not that we know of!

23:14.730 --> 23:15.770
Hurry up!

23:15.770 --> 23:18.020
We gotta put the news out there 
before other newspapers!

23:18.020 --> 23:18.930
Yes, sir!

23:20.240 --> 23:23.010
This is a huge scoop!

23:26.220 --> 23:31.010
<b>Unprecedented! A Beta Party in the Ranking Tournament!</b>

23:35.520 --> 23:40.020
<b>  </b>Episode 6

23:35.520 --> 23:40.020
<b>  Final Round</b>

23:36.270 --> 23:38.650
Next episode, "Final Round."
